      "created_at": "2018-06-15T03:11:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This came up in a two player - I was playing Spread of Rampant Green, my friend was playing Heart of the Wildfire. I happened to get Entwined Power, which worked out great, letting my teammate use Firestorm to spread damage all over my lands (that had blight).</p><p>I realized after the game might not be technically legal given how the two effects are worded - could I get an official ruling either way?</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
